Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The owner's checkout is not at `D:\crusorAIagent\PulseAIRepo` — that path does not exist on the host, so
every command in these docs dies at `cd`. 69 repo-root references rewritten across 18 files, in all
three spellings the docs use: `\`, the doubled `\\` inside code blocks, and `/`. That includes §6 of
the desktop runbook, which the owner runs by hand.

**Scope: repo-root references only, deliberately.** Parent-only paths are left alone, because "the repo
is not under `D:\crusorAIagent`" does not establish that the parent folder is gone — the repo may simply
have moved. Rewriting these could break a command that still works:
`D:\crusorAIagent\crusor-res\cancel-session-artifacts\CDP_test` (CDP_TEST_GUIDE.md),
`D:\crusorAIagent\browser-verify.png` (run-all.bat:55 and crusor-webview/e2e-verify.spec.ts:17),
`D:/crusorAIagent/playground` (DESKTOP_MANAGER_REGISTRATION_VERIFY.md), and
`D:\crusorAIagent\python_test.exe` (TEST_AGENT_GUIDE.md). They are flagged to the owner: if the parent
was renamed rather than the repo moved, these move too and I will do them in one pass.

